  "root_review": [
    "Root read all five core sources: prefix-sum weighted sampling with a 64-bit LCG ticket and per-pixel jitter; exact dyadic-rational nearest-pixel mass assignment with tie-to-first-site and canonical binary64 centroids; passive-carrier validation with exact T*C+M work preflight and TIME_GAP/NUMERIC_OVERFLOW precedence; exact-rational degeneracy tests, per-(vertex, smoothing group) normal accumulation and UV-seam vertex duplication; sphere-tracing with nonsmooth flags, 6-sample estimated normals and explicit miss classification.",
    "All 132 pure fixture cases pass against source and the fresh offline-installed package (30 weighted-image, 21 recorded-controls, 38 mesh attributes with 2 independent normal oracles, 43 implicit rays); installed byte inventory equals the packed stage.",
    "Root ran all five native harnesses under the shared render lease and reviewed the frames: density inversion resamples the same relief; one centroid step visibly collapses marks into mass centers; dot-to-stitch and ink edits retain point geometry; an independent thermal mask transfers without resampling; the vessel shows smooth vs flat lighting, cap UV seams and an independent ribbon transfer; the implicit study distinguishes welded/cut, hard-union and perforated-shell scenes.",
    "Word echo drives contour and spiral marks from hash-checked bundled-font glyphs and authored deterministic PCM features; the non-audio series changes the sampled control values, later query times change geometry, and reset/reload restores exact canvas pixels.",
    "Root operated both web studies in the live Studio app over localhost (pinned headless Chromium, 640x640 P2D): weighted-image-atlas re-rendered in 50-211 ms per structural edit (source, invert, count, centroid, mark shape) and word-echo in 43-57 ms (time, word, series, transfer, spacing, scale); no page errors. Export PNG captured from the real export dialog matched the displayed canvas byte-for-byte (150607 and 112205 bytes), and reload restored the exact default canvas for both.",
    "The dev-only 'Project service unavailable' banner is environmental (the separate Go project service is not running); the studio remains fully editable on its local draft with local recovery, which the app surfaces as status.",
    "Historical acceptance bytes are preserved; the two 3D studies join native-only gallery membership and the two web studies join the generated gallery with attestation-bound operations."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Original scoped p5 workflows, not source-artwork recreations or new technique attestations; Java, py5 and Android targets remain deferred by their contracts.",
    "Weighted sampling is mass-proportional with per-pixel jitter, not minimum-distance packing; multiple marks may originate from one pixel.",
    "Recorded controls sample caller-supplied explicit records; feature extraction, audio, fonts and media remain host work. The bundled GlyphMarks face does not imply general multilingual shaping.",
    "Surface attributes are explicit per-corner data for a supplied indexed mesh; no weld, chart or material inference. Degenerate faces are rejected, not repaired.",
    "Implicit rays are bounded CPU sphere-tracing with estimated or explicitly undefined normals; no GPU raymarching or exact predicate guarantee.",
    "Only pinned Chromium Canvas2D density1 and software WebGL native profiles executed; cross-browser and other-target behavior is not accepted by this review."
  ],
